mode: "100644"
text: "# content-pillars.md Template\n\nThe output of this skill. Keep it tight and usable — `batch-content-plan` and the content skills\nread it to know what to post and which pillar each post serves.\n\nCopy everything below the line into `content-pillars.md` and fill it in.\n\n---\n\n```markdown\n# Content Pillars — {Business or Client Name}\n<!-- version: 1.0 · updated: {date} · derived from: brand-profile v{n} -->\n\n## The set at a glance\n- ⭐ **{Signature pillar name}** — {one line} — ~{x}% of mix\n- **{Pillar 2 name}** — {one line} — ~{x}%\n- **{Pillar 3 name}** — {one line} — ~{x}%\n- **{Pillar 4 name}** — {one line} — ~{x}%\n- (3–5 total; promotion is the minority)\n\n---\n\n## ⭐ Pillar 1 — {Signature pillar name}\n- **Covers:** {the subject area, in plain terms}\n- **Why we own it:** {the specific reason this brand is credible/distinctive here}\n- **For:** {which audience segment}\n- **Goal it serves:** {awareness / trust / conversion / community}\n- **Example angles:** {5–8 sub-topics or post angles}\n- **Draws on:** {proof, assets, stories, expertise it uses}\n\n## Pillar 2 — {name}\n- **Covers:** …\n- **Why we own it:** …\n- **For:** …\n- **Goal it serves:** …\n- **Example angles:** …\n- **Draws on:** …\n\n## Pillar 3 — {name}\n- {same fields}\n\n## Pillar 4 — {name}\n- {same fields}\n\n---\n\n## Mix & balance\n- **Signature pillar:** {which one} — the differentiator, posted often.\n- **Rough split across pillars:** {e.g., 35 / 25 / 25 / 15}\n- **Promotion:** kept to the minority; rides on the value pillars.\n- **Notes:** {seasonality, campaign overlays, multi-audience notes}\n```\n\n---\n\n## How downstream skills read this\n\n- **`batch-content-plan`** spreads posts across these pillars, tags every slot to one, and uses\n  the **example angles** as starting ideas and the **mix split** for balance.\n- **Content skills** (`caption-writer`, `reels-script`, …) use the pillar's *angle* and *goal* to\n  shape each post, and the **draws-on** assets/proof for substance.\n- If a pillar's **example angles** run dry over time, that's the signal to refresh it — re-mine\n  the brand profile or run this skill again.\n\nKeep the signature pillar prominent: it's what the brand is building recognition for.\n"
